# hardware-properties: the native-gpu calibration line of the local RTX 5080 (MAPAL_GPU_CALIB, or copy it to
# ~/.cache/mapal/gpu-calib). Key: the device query's physical facts (`DeviceQuery::calib_key`), never a name.
# Values: `calib.cu` / `calib2.cu` / CUPTI measurements, sources in profile.rs `RTX_5080` and in this directory
# (E1-rtx-5080.txt, B-bw-rtx-5080.tsv, B-lds-rtx-5080.txt; gsync: kernel-merging.md Calls; copy:
# hardware-properties.md; row_iter_ns, coop_first_ns: long-rows.md; coop_body_cycles: calib.cu body, review-fixes.md §5 — cycles at this line's clock_khz); fly_bytes_per_sm: calib.cu bw `fly`, B-bw-rtx-5080.tsv (gemv-stream.md). clock_khz is the measured clock under load (the query reports the boost clock).
cc=120 sms=84 l2=67108864 mem=15001000x256	flops_per_ns=32200 bytes_per_ns=2553 launch_ns=11130 issue_ns=1690 gap_ns=260 zero_ns=790 atomic_ops_per_ns=400 l2_bytes_per_ns=4500 dram_bytes_per_ns=890 eff_max_pm=800 eff_half=6 lat_ns=573 lsu_ipc_pm=500 fill_bytes_per_ns=2320 tail_bytes_per_ns=1740 gsync_ns=553 gsync_block_ps=1890 dep_launch_ns=650 dep_launch_block_ps=0 pdl_launch_ns=486 coop_launch_ns=2044 pageable_pm=695 row_iter_ns=87 coop_first_ns=38000 sm_bytes_per_ns=94 coop_body_cycles=4390 fly_bytes_per_sm=8192 fp32_lanes=128 clock_khz=2450000
